<title>USA: De Rigo 12-month sales fall.</title>
<headline>De Rigo 12-month sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>De Rigo Group said Monday that its 12-month net sales fell by 13.7 percent to 260.4 billion lire ($168.8 million), after reporting net sales of 301.6 billion lire last year.</p>
<p>The Italian sunglass frame manufacturer said it posted 250.7 billion lire ($162.5 million) in direct sales of frames compared with 285 billion lire last year.</p>
<p>The company said the results denominated in U.S. dollars are converted at the average exchange rate of $1.00 equal to 1543.1 Italian lire, for 1996 and 1995 periods.</p>
